{"id":"ec1d9c6fcc3c0767","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md","title":"真理理论对角线引理","display":"df-diagonal-lemma-truth — 真理理论对角线引理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth","aliases":["91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth"],"display":"df-diagonal-lemma-truth — 真理理论对角线引理","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-diagonal-function]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diagonal-lemma-truth — 真理理论对角线引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b31ce2c72a177855\" href=\"?note=b31ce2c72a177855\" title=\"91-df-diagonal-function\">91-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-diagonal-lemma-truth-—-理论对角线引理-$\\mathrm{Diag}_T$\">df-diagonal-lemma-truth — 理论对角线引理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}_T\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_T\\)</span> (扩展语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 中表述且能表示所需句法函数的算术理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rep}_S(\\mathrm{diag})\">\\(\\operatorname{Rep}_S(\\mathrm{diag})\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 正确表示对角函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diag}_T(S)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Rep}_S(\\mathrm{diag})\\land\n\\forall\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\nS\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diag}_T(S)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Rep}_S(\\mathrm{diag})\\land\n\\forall\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\nS\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}_T\\)</span> : 真理理论中的对角线引理</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>：至多含一个指定自由数变量的公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> : 固定点句子（对角线句子）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：对角线引理保证：对任意含一个自由变量的公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>，存在句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>使得<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>等价于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\">\\(\\varphi(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\)</span>。这揭示了形式系统中自指的普遍性。</p>\n<p>对角线引理的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自指不是偶然，而是形式系统的固有特征</li>\n<li>任何有足够算术能力的系统都存在自指句子</li>\n<li>真理谓词的自指导致悖论（说谎者）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>典型应用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>说谎者句子</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)=\\neg T(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)=\\neg T(x)\\)</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 证明相应固定点等价</li>\n<li><strong>真理者句子</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)=T(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)=T(x)\\)</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 证明相应固定点等价</li>\n<li><strong>Gödel句子</strong>：取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x) = \\neg \\mathrm{Prov}(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x) = \\neg \\mathrm{Prov}(x)\\)</span>，得经典Gödel句子</li>\n</ol>\n<p>真理理论的应对：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>分层语言仍适用对角线引理，但层级 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的真理谓词不能语义地作用于包含自身层级的句子</li>\n<li>型自由语言允许对含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的公式取固定点，因此真理公理必须受控</li>\n<li>KF 在经典对象理论中公理化强 Kleene 固定点语义，而不是把背景证明逻辑改成部分逻辑</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-diagonal-lemma-truth-—-理论对角线引理-$\\mathrm{Diag}_T$","text":"df-diagonal-lemma-truth — 理论对角线引理 $\\mathrm{Diag}_T$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"b31ce2c72a177855","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diag}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rep}_S(\\mathrm{diag})","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diag}_T(S)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Rep}_S(\\mathrm{diag})\\land\n\\forall\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\nS\\vdash\\bigl(\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diag}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)=\\neg T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)=T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x) = \\neg \\mathrm{Prov}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2179,"backlinks":[{"id":"b31ce2c72a177855","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对角线函数与对角线引理的关系：\n对角线引理（见[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]）利用$\\mathrm{diag}$构造自指句子："},{"id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5b7ca526c5d0bb9a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"724d38bcb2abeb43","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T